:: Michael & Felix Park Soccer Match [nobr]

/* Written by: Pocodesu */
/* Intro */

You walk down the sidewalk making sure to jump over all the cracks. You are currently pretending they are large crevices that will swallow you up should you step on one. After a particularly big jump you look up and notice a group of boys playing soccer nearby. Wanting to get a better look, you press up against a nearby tree and peek around it without making yourself too obvious. You don’t recognize any of the older boys that you assume are high schoolers, though you do see a few familiar faces among them. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> and… was that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> too? From what you could tell your two friends were on opposing teams. <br>

